SiteScribe database migrations
==============================

The migration environment reads ``DATABASE_URL`` and normalizes Render's
``postgres://`` alias to SQLAlchemy's psycopg 3 driver. Production migrations
target PostgreSQL. SQLite is supported for unit tests and local schema checks;
PostgreSQL supplies native UUID storage while SQLAlchemy's portable ``Uuid``
type preserves the same Python interface on SQLite.

Commands (after Alembic and psycopg are installed by the dependency task):

    alembic -c migrations/alembic.ini upgrade head
    alembic -c migrations/alembic.ini downgrade base

